{
  "version": "1.6.2",
  "notes": "Attachment-aware workspace release. Attached text/code files can now be passed to the local chat model as hidden context, and DOCX, PPTX and XLSX text is extracted locally with standard-library parsers. PDFs are extracted when a local pdftotext binary is available. Adds drag/drop and pasted-file support, compressed local image previews, attachment preparation/status feedback, and safer empty-prompt attachment sending. Image previews remain local only; pixel-level visual understanding is not claimed. The 1.6.1 chats/projects/sidebar/Live workspace, 1.6.0 deterministic Preview Edit fix and faster multi-source research, and all existing Update, Voice, Stop, Chat/Live, artifact preview, regeneration and download/export behavior remain cumulative.",
